 "description": "A creator wallet's launch history: launches, graduation rate, launch cadence, how fast the dev sells, verdict. Looks up every token the wallet created since recording began and replays the dev's own trades on its 15 most recent launches. When to use: For the creator of a token; pass the dev wallet, not the mint (pump_token (callable here by name) reports the dev of a mint). Price: $0.01 per call (10 free/day; after that a payment-required result lists x402 options). Errors: returns isError with a message for invalid input or an upstream failure (not charged).",
 "inputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "creator": {
    "description": "creator (dev) wallet. Base58 Solana address, 32-44 chars.",
    "pattern": "^[1-9A-HJ-NP-Za-km-z]{32,44}$",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
